<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Pengingat Laporan MagangHub</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Laporan dan kehadiran {{TANGGAL}} belum tercatat. Batas isi 23.59 WIB.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />

    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#0f1729" font-size="15px" line-height="24px" padding="0" />
      <mj-section padding="0" />
      <mj-column padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>

    <mj-style>
      @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .card-pad { padding-left: 22px !important; padding-right: 22px !important; }
        .headline { font-size: 23px !important; line-height: 30px !important; }
        /* Chip tanggal & batas isi menumpuk vertikal di layar HP */
        .chip-cell { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; padding: 0 !important; }
        .chip-gap { display: none !important; height: 0 !important; line-height: 0 !important; font-size: 0 !important; }
        .chip-stack { padding-bottom: 8px !important; }
        .step-cell { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; padding: 0 0 6px 0 !important; }
        .arrow-cell { display: none !important; }
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        .dm-bg { background-color: #0a0f17 !important; }
        .dm-card { background-color: #111a26 !important; }
        .dm-title { color: #eef3fa !important; }
        .dm-body { color: #b6c3d3 !important; }
        .dm-muted { color: #7c8b9d !important; }
        .dm-chip { background-color: #16212e !important; border-color: #22303f !important; }
        .dm-chip-warn { background-color: #2a2113 !important; border-color: #4a3a17 !important; }
        .dm-chip-label { color: #7c8b9d !important; }
        .dm-chip-value { color: #eef3fa !important; }
        .dm-note { background-color: #16212e !important; border-color: #22303f !important; }
        .dm-rule { border-color: #1f2b39 !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f4f6fa" width="600px" css-class="dm-bg">
    <mj-section padding="36px 16px 10px 16px" background-color="#f4f6fa" css-class="dm-bg">
      <mj-column background-color="#ffffff" border-radius="16px" padding="0" css-class="dm-card">

        <!-- Accent bar -->
        <mj-text padding="0" font-size="0" line-height="0">
          <div style="height:5px;line-height:5px;font-size:0;background-color:#0b60ea;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;">&nbsp;</div>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Brand line -->
        <mj-text padding="30px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
            <tr>
              <td style="vertical-align:middle;padding-right:9px;">
                <div style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#0b60ea;text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">M</div>
              </td>
              <td style="vertical-align:middle;">
                <div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#65758b;font-weight:700;">MagangHub &middot; Pengingat harian</div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Headline -->
        <mj-text padding="14px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div class="dm-title headline" style="font-size:26px;line-height:33px;font-weight:700;color:#0f1729;letter-spacing:-0.2px;">Laporan hari ini belum diisi</div>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="10px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div class="dm-body" style="font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#3f4d61;">
            Dashboard MagangHub belum mencatat laporan dan kehadiran kamu untuk
            {{TANGGAL}}. Isi sebelum batas pengisian supaya tidak dihitung alpa.
          </div>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Chips: tanggal + batas isi -->
        <mj-text padding="20px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
            <tr>
              <td class="chip-cell" width="50%" style="padding:0 5px 0 0;vertical-align:top;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                       class="dm-chip"
                       style="background-color:#f7f9fc;border:1px solid #e5e8ee;border-radius:11px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:12px 15px;">
                      <div class="dm-chip-label" style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7c8b9d;font-weight:700;">Tanggal</div>
                      <div class="dm-chip-value" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#0f1729;font-weight:700;padding-top:3px;">{{TANGGAL}}</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
              <td class="chip-gap" width="10" style="width:10px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
              <td class="chip-cell chip-stack" width="50%" style="padding:0 0 0 5px;vertical-align:top;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                       class="dm-chip-warn"
                       style="background-color:#fff8ec;border:1px solid #f7e3bd;border-radius:11px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:12px 15px;">
                      <div class="dm-chip-label" style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a5f0f;font-weight:700;">Batas isi</div>
                      <div class="dm-chip-value" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#0f1729;font-weight:700;padding-top:3px;">23.59 WIB</div>
                      <div style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#8a5f0f;padding-top:2px;">{{SISA}}</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Checklist -->
        <mj-text padding="22px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7c8b9d;font-weight:700;padding-bottom:9px;">Yang harus diisi</div>
          <div class="dm-body" style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:#25324a;">
            <span style="color:#0b60ea;font-weight:700;">1.</span>&nbsp; Kehadiran: absen masuk dan absen pulang<br />
            <span style="color:#0b60ea;font-weight:700;">2.</span>&nbsp; Laporan aktivitas harian<br />
            <span style="color:#0b60ea;font-weight:700;">3.</span>&nbsp; Cek pengumuman terbaru di Beranda
          </div>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Alur status (istilah mengikuti halaman Riwayat Kehadiran) -->
        <mj-text padding="20px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7c8b9d;font-weight:700;padding-bottom:9px;">Alur status di Riwayat</div>
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
            <tr>
              <td class="step-cell" width="30%" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 4px 0 0;">
                <div style="border:1px solid #e5e8ee;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px;">
                  <div style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background-color:#94a3b8;font-size:0;line-height:9px;">&nbsp;</div>
                  <div class="dm-chip-label" style="font-size:10.5px;line-height:15px;color:#65758b;font-weight:600;padding-top:6px;">Belum diisi</div>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="arrow-cell" width="5%" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#b6c1cf;">&rarr;</td>
              <td class="step-cell" width="30%" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 4px;">
                <div style="border:1px solid #cfe0fb;background-color:#f5f9ff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px;">
                  <div style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;background-color:#0b60ea;font-size:0;line-height:9px;transform:rotate(45deg);">&nbsp;</div>
                  <div class="dm-chip-label" style="font-size:10.5px;line-height:15px;color:#0b60ea;font-weight:700;padding-top:6px;">Menunggu tindakan mentor</div>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="arrow-cell" width="5%" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#b6c1cf;">&rarr;</td>
              <td class="step-cell" width="30%" style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 0 4px;">
                <div style="border:1px solid #cdebd8;background-color:#f4fbf6;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px;">
                  <div style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background-color:#12a150;font-size:0;line-height:9px;">&nbsp;</div>
                  <div class="dm-chip-label" style="font-size:10.5px;line-height:15px;color:#0d7a3c;font-weight:700;padding-top:6px;">Hadir disetujui</div>
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Catatan -->
        <mj-text padding="18px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                 class="dm-note"
                 style="background-color:#f7f9fc;border:1px solid #e5e8ee;border-radius:12px;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:14px 16px 15px 16px;">
                <div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7c8b9d;font-weight:700;padding-bottom:7px;">Catatan</div>
                <div class="dm-body" style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px;color:#4a5a70;">
                  &bull;&nbsp; Setelah dikirim, laporan berstatus <b style="color:#0b60ea;">Menunggu tindakan mentor</b>
                  sampai disetujui. Tidak ada tindakan tambahan dari kamu.<br />
                  &bull;&nbsp; Izin dibayar maksimal 3 hari per periode. Izin ke-4 dan seterusnya
                  tidak dibayar, tetapi tidak dihitung alpa.<br />
                  &bull;&nbsp; Lewat dari 23.59 WIB tanpa laporan dihitung tidak hadir.<br />
                  &bull;&nbsp; Sabtu, Minggu, dan hari libur ditandai <b>Hari Libur</b> di Riwayat,
                  tidak perlu mengisi laporan.
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <mj-button href="{{SITE}}" background-color="#0b60ea" color="#ffffff"
                   font-size="15px" font-weight="700" border-radius="10px"
                   inner-padding="14px 28px" align="left" padding="22px 34px 0 34px"
                   css-class="card-pad" letter-spacing="0">
          Buka Dashboard
        </mj-button>
        <mj-text padding="11px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div class="dm-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#7c8b9d;">
            atau buka manual:
            <a href="{{SITE}}" target="_blank" style="color:#0b60ea;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">{{SITE_HOST}}</a>
          </div>
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <mj-text padding="24px 34px 0 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div class="dm-rule" style="border-top:1px solid #eceff4;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:0;">&nbsp;</div>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="13px 34px 26px 34px" css-class="card-pad">
          <div class="dm-muted" style="font-size:11.5px;line-height:18px;color:#8b98a8;">
            Pengingat otomatis setiap hari kerja, dikirim sebelum batas pengisian.
            Email ini tidak perlu dibalas.
          </div>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0 16px 34px 16px" background-color="#f4f6fa" css-class="dm-bg">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <div class="dm-muted" style="font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#9aa6b6;">
            MagangHub &middot; Kementerian Ketenagakerjaan RI
          </div>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
